"description":"You are the Ice Man. With your awesome power over the elements, you have everything you need to make the bad guys chill! Become the icy superhero, and protect the city from the thugs who threaten it. Freeze your enemies with your icy super powers, and shatter them to satisfying pieces with your bare hands! You don’t need a weapon to show them who’s the boss.\n \nUnlock tons of new superpowers and prove your strength to anyone foolish enough to challenge  you! All the power you need is right in your hands but you will need to think quickly and use the best strategy to shoot, freeze and destroy your enemies before they can get to you! Become a sub-zero master of ice and make sure no one can get past your freezing touch!\n \nBe the Ice Master! \nFreeze your enemies and shatter them to tiny bits before time runs out. Being the hero has never been this fun! \n\n Lots of Cool Powers\nUnlock the coolest superpowers. Begin with your Ice Beam and upgrade to Frost Nova, Blizzard, Frozen Hand and more.\n\nEasy Freezy!\nWith easy to learn controls, you’ll have so much fun blasting your enemies with the powers of ice, but don’t be fooled, each new level brings new challenges for you to overcome!   \n \nSatisfying 3D \nUnleash the wrath of the elements in stunning 3D. It looks so real, you’ll wonder why your mobile hasn’t frozen over! \n\n\nFrom the Studio that brought you Mr. Bullet, Happy Glass, Ink Inc and Love Balls!\n\nFollow us to get news and updates on our other Award Winning titles;\nhttps://lionstudios.cc/\nFacebook.com/LionStudios.cc\nInstagram.com/LionStudioscc\nTwitter.com/LionStudiosCC\nYoutube.com/c/LionStudiosCC", "minimumOsVersion":"11.0", "averageUserRating":4.7718199999999999505462255910970270633697509765625, "trackCensoredName":"Ice Man 3D", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/ice-man-3d/id1552374995?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"12+", "sellerUrl":"https://lionstudios.cc/", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN", "FR", "DE", "JA", "KO", "ZH", "ES", "ZH"], "fileSizeBytes":"506685440", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":10996, "trackContentRating":"12+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.7718199999999999505462255910970270633697509765625, "userRatingCount":10996}, 
